<p>		$0.01	    --     ($0.06)     --</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares outstanding</p>
<p>		4,472	    --	4,472	--</p>
<p>NOTE: The increase in weighted average common shares outstanding for both periods is primarily a result of the issuance of 1,955,000 common shares in the company's initial public offering which was completed in June 1996 and an increase in common shares attributable to the acquisition of Total Facilities Management in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
